20.6 Why Is This Better?

Suppose someone writes
Counter counter = new Counter();

synchronized(counter){
    // Long running operation
}

Question

Will
counter.increment();

be blocked?
Answer
No.

Why?
Because
increment()
uses
synchronized(lock)

NOT

synchronized(this)
Different monitors.

